[MATH] verify whether the Differences readout can call two products equal on price when their real prices differ: it compares a MINIMUM against an ACTUAL, so equality on this row = @td(PROD_CMP_VARIATIONS.minVariationPrice) equal to the plain product's price, which is not the same claim as the two products being equally priced {HYPOTHESIS}
